<title>USA: Bank/Southington says may get bought.</title>
<headline>Bank/Southington says may get bought.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTHINGTON, Conn. 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Southington said Thursday it received and is reviewing proposals to acquire the bank.</p>
<p>It said there was no assurance whether or when the bank would sign a deal.</p>
<p>It said Endicott Financial Advisors LLC of New York is advising the bank.</p>
<p>Shares fell 3-1/4 to 20.</p>
</text>
